17. Subjects who have a history of alcohol dependence, or have a positive alcohol test result at screening/baseline;
18. Subjects who have consumed alcoholic beverages within 48 h prior to enrollment;
19. Subjects who have a history of drug abuse, or have a positive drug abuse test result at screening/baseline;
